				<r3d:description language="eng">Health Data Nova Scotia (HDNS), is a data repository based in the Faculty of Medicine&#039;s, Department of Community Health and Epidemiology at Dalhousie University, focused on supporting data driven research for a healthier Nova Scotia. HDNS facilitates research and innovation in Nova Scotia by providing access to linkable administrative health data and analysis for research and health service assessment purposes in a secure, controlled environment, while respecting the privacy and confidentiality of Nova Scotians.</r3d:description>
